<document type="book">
    <section id="sec:identities">
      <title>Algebraic identities</title>

      Numbering continues across the project: this is chapter 2, even though it
      lives in a different file. We can also reach back to results from chapter
      one — recall <ref to="thm:pyth"/>. Clicking it previews a copy of the theorem
      shipped into this page, and the jump button opens its home chapter.

      <theorem id="thm:binomial">
        <title>Binomial square</title>
        For all real $a$ and $b$, $$(a + b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2.$$
      </theorem>

      Setting $b \to -b$ recovers the difference of squares, a cousin of the
      geometric result <ref to="thm:pyth"/> rests on. The historical thread runs
      back through the classics <cite paper="euclid"/>.
    </section>
</document>
